> Module BarnesGroupTaxModel

```catala
declaration scope BarnesGroupTaxComputation:
  input direct_repatriated_cash content money
  input domestic_stock_basis content money
  input applicable_earnings content money
  input tax_rate content decimal

  internal remaining_applicable_earnings content money

  output direct_cash_inclusion content money
  output total_inclusion content money
  output section_956_inclusion content money
  output tax_due content money

scope BarnesGroupTaxComputation:
  definition direct_cash_inclusion equals
    if direct_repatriated_cash < applicable_earnings
    then direct_repatriated_cash
    else applicable_earnings

  definition remaining_applicable_earnings equals
    applicable_earnings - direct_cash_inclusion

  definition section_956_inclusion equals
    if domestic_stock_basis < remaining_applicable_earnings
    then domestic_stock_basis
    else remaining_applicable_earnings

  definition total_inclusion equals
    direct_cash_inclusion + section_956_inclusion

  definition tax_due equals total_inclusion * tax_rate
```
